  "abstract": "Test projection rank p=34 under Adam (no wd) with global gradient clipping (norm=1.0) on the best global MLP. Prior p=34 with AdamW scored \u22120.026653; this isolates p under the Adam+clip stack. Loss: MAE+temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4).",
